        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                "word": "Tibet",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f1844abd-f4d5-4154-8861-44df5b117b3f",
                        "entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "Thibet"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "85289f4e-4fd7-3e3e-9b52-f4600d0db0e6",
                        "entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Zone géographique située au nord de l’Himalaya, qu’on appelle le « Toit du monde », formée de hauts plateaux désertiques dominés par de puissantes chaînes de montagnes d’ouest en est."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "toponymic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "520aaab6-d37f-437d-8c28-6023851cf513",
                                "sense_id": "85289f4e-4fd7-3e3e-9b52-f4600d0db0e6",
                                "text": "Une série de cinq empreintes de mains et cinq empreintes de pieds préservées dans du calcaire d'eau douce déposé autour d'une source chaude a été découverte près d'un affluent de la rivière Xiong Qu, près du village de Quesang, à environ 80 km au nord-ouest de Lhassa, au Tibet."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea7d1aa1-6ac3-3a97-96c3-1b41195f67c9",
                        "entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Région autonome de Chine située dans l’Himalaya, occupant ce territoire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "toponymic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7c0b1bfe-39d7-409f-9466-0522937d7cd4",
                                "sense_id": "ea7d1aa1-6ac3-3a97-96c3-1b41195f67c9",
                                "text": "Le dalaï-lama venait de quitter son palais du Potala, à Lhassa, à la faveur d’une tempête de sable, et de prendre la fuite avec des moinillons de douze ans et de vieux lamas au souffle perdu, pour échapper aux troupes du général chinois Tan Kuan-san qui envahissaient le Tibet."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9f8b1475-53b3-32e2-a431-440c692c8980",
                        "entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Zone de peuplement des Tibétains correspondant à une aire linguistique où le tibétain est la langue majoritairement utilisée, ainsi qu’à une aire culturelle à la spécificité marquée."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Pays"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08bae45f-7a5c-468c-84e5-09ea0b3642e8",
                                "sense_id": "9f8b1475-53b3-32e2-a431-440c692c8980",
                                "text": "Le bouddhisme lamaïque a créé depuis le XIIIᵉ siècle des liens étroits entre le Tibet et la Mongolie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48623cd5-9cc3-4817-9a35-5b1c100ab7b9",
                                "sense_id": "9f8b1475-53b3-32e2-a431-440c692c8980",
                                "text": "Peu de chefs religieux bénéficient d’une réputation aussi enviable que celle de Tenzin Gyasto, chef spirituel et temporel du Tibet bouddhiste, qui se fait aussi appeler Sa Sainteté le dalaï-lama."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ff8c5b3f-f24c-44f9-884c-1e80c2e0aaea",
                        "source_entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "source_sense_description": "Région d’Asie",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tibet",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tibet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df1f39ff-a60c-33fc-aa22-7f598654d53d",
                                        "entry_id": "165cc80f-3733-3f86-8d73-73b44799a9f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hochland in Zentralasien"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "geography"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3b7f32c-8f65-4c75-9090-431e5aa7467a",
                                                "sense_id": "df1f39ff-a60c-33fc-aa22-7f598654d53d",
                                                "text": "„In Tibet herrscht Hochlandklima mit großen Tagestemperaturschwankungen und viel Sonnenschein.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "557b8699-bb39-431f-b38c-638d81949cb2",
                                                "sense_id": "df1f39ff-a60c-33fc-aa22-7f598654d53d",
                                                "text": "„Dieser Tage waren Mönche aus dem Tibet mit ihren orangefarbenen Kutten zu Gast in Norddeutschland.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b76c8860-e52c-4728-bce7-f66d8709bc64",
                                                "sense_id": "df1f39ff-a60c-33fc-aa22-7f598654d53d",
                                                "text": "„Er hatte sieben Jahre lang in der Hauptstadt Tibets und in den Zentren des Buddhismus in Bhutan und Nepal studiert.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "364d423e-5109-3cca-a364-7315a276502e",
                                        "entry_id": "165cc80f-3733-3f86-8d73-73b44799a9f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Verwaltungseinheit der Volksrepublik China, die etwa die Hälfte des gleichnamigen Hochlands umfasst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00a93ebd-a8a3-4936-83ff-2e4725af3257",
                                                "sense_id": "364d423e-5109-3cca-a364-7315a276502e",
                                                "text": "„Nach offiziellen chinesischen Angaben gibt es zurzeit in Tibet wieder über 1700 Stätten für tibetisch-buddhistische Aktivitäten mit etwa 46.000 buddhistischen Mönchen und Nonnen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdaa2684-0830-43c7-9ad7-5da3ce397e58",
                                                "sense_id": "364d423e-5109-3cca-a364-7315a276502e",
                                                "text": "„Der Dalai Lama lebt seit 1959 im Exil. Peking wirft ihm vor, auf die Unabhängigkeit Tibets hinzuarbeiten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tibet",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef73d47f-46dd-3785-a8a6-981b87a238a4",
                                        "entry_id": "d1c380b6-b84a-3fd9-baf5-b3237fe48be6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wolle der Tibetziege"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8d5b37f-86e7-4c23-a626-00cac890cd47",
                                                "sense_id": "ef73d47f-46dd-3785-a8a6-981b87a238a4",
                                                "text": "Tibet ist Kaschmir und Mohair sehr ähnlich."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd7f1029-0fb0-3416-a9e1-480de1462ac3",
                                        "entry_id": "d1c380b6-b84a-3fd9-baf5-b3237fe48be6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "hochwertige Reißwolle"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "90a26df6-a1f7-4e60-b658-8647dd004ef0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f49c8e6f-c368-3bbe-be5d-f5284a503b20",
                        "source_sense_description": "Région d’Asie",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tibet",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tibet",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f29acb48-3acd-3f3b-96c1-31f651d7b5d2",
                                        "entry_id": "31adeafd-be1e-3760-904f-5443affaecb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A geographic region in Central Asia (mostly in China), the homeland of the Tibetan people, covering much of the Tibetan Plateau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eef64b42-6d10-4648-a9a8-c6a7f4c46ae2",
                                                "sense_id": "f29acb48-3acd-3f3b-96c1-31f651d7b5d2",
                                                "text": "The Province of Xenſi extends to the Kingdom of Preſter John. Caſcar and Thebet, which the Chineſes in a general Name call Sifan it is a large Province, and is divided into eight Counties, having one hundred and eighty Cities: Sigan is the Metropolis of the whole, ſeated on the River Guei, in a moſt pleaſant and delightful place, of a noble Proſpect, and good Trade."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b05e0ae-542a-4c01-84cb-18fb836c0c30",
                                                "sense_id": "f29acb48-3acd-3f3b-96c1-31f651d7b5d2",
                                                "text": "A giant rally on Formosa reflects the worldwide concern for Tibet's heroic rebels. Speaking to sixty-thousand people in Taipei, President Chiang Kai-shek says Tibet's resistance foreshadows a vast anti-communist uprising on the mainland of China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61946ba9-70e8-3b7e-b5bb-5731328d401a",
                                        "entry_id": "31adeafd-be1e-3760-904f-5443affaecb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A former country in East Asia that existed from 1912 until its annexation by China in 1951."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e7a4096-2357-4128-822f-17b45ceb8f25",
                                                "sense_id": "61946ba9-70e8-3b7e-b5bb-5731328d401a",
                                                "text": "The estimated population of the Chinese Empire (exclusive of Tibet) is given, on the basis of this census, as 329,542,000, while the population of Tibet is estimated at 1,500,000."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f23ae70-8b1b-4d63-a8a0-bcdfeeea2c15",
                                                "sense_id": "61946ba9-70e8-3b7e-b5bb-5731328d401a",
                                                "text": "Third, we should open up two new international broadcasting stations—Radio Free China and Radio Free Tibet— to provide these nations with independent information and commentary.[...]The people of Tibet represent a separate case. Conquered by the Chinese in 1950, occupied brutally by troops who killed thousands, desecrated local cultural and religious sites, and denied reasonable demands for autonomy, Tibetans have elicited much sympathy but little support from the outside world. The outrage over the brutal killings of peaceful demonstrators in Lhasa in March 1989 quickly faded after the massacres in Beijing in June. While there is a limit to what we can do, we should do more than we have done. In addition to raising the issue of Tibet in bilateral talks, we should establish Radio Free Tibet so that its people, though isolated, will no longer feel abandoned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90550e3d-18f1-477b-951c-3d6a66363c6f",
                                                "sense_id": "61946ba9-70e8-3b7e-b5bb-5731328d401a",
                                                "text": "I also supported more political freedom in China, and had recently invited the Dalai Lama and Hong Kong human rights activist Martin Lee to the White House to highlight my support for the cultural and religious integrity of Tibet and for maintaining Hong Kong's democracy now that the UK had restored it to China."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "54df383f-5941-3f11-9b1a-7ff6d322ecb3",
                                        "entry_id": "31adeafd-be1e-3760-904f-5443affaecb9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An autonomous region of China. Official name: Tibet Autonomous Region. Capital: Lhasa."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
